    "howto": "Cells 0, 1, 2 run left to right across the back row; 3, 4, 5 across the front. Choose tile_1 through tile_5 and the directed adjacent source-to-blank form. Every move swaps one tile and the blank; tiles stay on the board. Claim the exact 1, 2, 3 / 4, 5, blank layout for a green marker. A later move clears it. Reset returns to the supplied reachable scramble. Each swap commits at hand contact; the picture changes cells without a simulated sliding path."
